溯，支撑内部审计与监管核查；\n2）复盘合规案例（如误报、风险事件），优化合规操作流程与规则。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，国际贸易、法学、合规管理、涉外事务等相关专业优先；\n2、3-5 年以上出口管制、贸易合规相关工作经验，有制造业 / 高科技行业出口管制合规经验优先，具备独立完成物项管制分类、制裁清单筛查以及出口许可申请等的实操经验；\n3、熟悉中美欧核心出口管制法规（EAR、ITAR、欧盟两用物项法规）及制裁清单（OFAC、BIS 等），能独立使用合规工具（如 SAP GTS以及ECSS等），或有合规系统操作经验；\n4、英语读写流利，能读懂外文法规原文与官方指引；\n5、有强风险意识与细节敏感度，能精准识别合规风险点；\n6、具备跨部门沟通能力，能高效对接业务端输出合规支持，能推动合规与业务的融合。","ClassificationOne":"社招","ClassificationTwo":"集团总部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-25T14:30:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"5229e0db-7781-4c2f-b212-622d8c194568","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351539447,"PostDateInt":1772522928000,"PostDate":"2026-03-03T15:28:48","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"售后技术工程师-能源科技","OrgId":602831,"Org":"产品管理部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"